@verbs temple temples
@tier player
@title how to worship a god, make offerings and pray
@see pray

                     Temple                              
                                                         
    - 'worship' to give yourself to this temple's god.    
      It is forever: you can never change your god.       
    - 'offer <item>' or 'offer <amount> coins' to make    
      an offering, if you are one of the faithful.        
    - 'pray <prayer>' to ask a favour, here or before     
      an altar or a statue dedicated to them.             
                                                         
